{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":54,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["祈求上帝的拯救"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["西弗人去告訴掃羅：「大衛藏在我們那裡。」那時大衛作了這首訓誨詩，交給樂長，用弦樂器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你憑你的名拯救我！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你用你的大能為我伸冤！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，求你垂聽我的禱告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"留心聽我口中的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為傲慢的人起來攻擊我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"目無上帝的暴徒正尋索我的性命。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，上帝幫助我，主扶持我，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必使我的仇敵因惡受報。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你憑信實毀滅他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，我甘心樂意地獻上祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要讚美你的名，因為你的名是美善的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你拯救我脫離一切艱難，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我傲視仇敵。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/54.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/55.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/53.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}